@startuml OtpState
title OTP state diagram
skinparam dpi 300

[*] --> Valid : OTP sent to registered\nemail or mobile (FR-01, FR-04)
Valid --> Valid : wrong OTP entered,\nattempt 1 or 2 (FR-01, FR-04)
Valid --> Used : correct OTP within 5 minutes\n(FR-01, FR-04)
Valid --> Expired : 5 minutes pass\n(FR-01, FR-04)
Valid --> Invalid : 3rd wrong OTP, or\nnew OTP requested\n(FR-01, FR-04)
Used --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Invalid --> [*]

note left of Valid
A new OTP request cancels
the previous OTP, so only
one OTP is valid at a time.
Limit: 5 requests in 15 minutes
(FR-01, FR-04).
end note
@enduml